      >>SOURCE FORMAT IS FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. COMPOSITE.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 NODE-TABLE.
   05 NODE-ENTRY OCCURS 5 TIMES.
      10 NODE-TYPE       PIC X.
      10 NODE-VALUE      PIC 9(4).
      10 NODE-EDGE-START PIC 9(2).
      10 NODE-EDGE-COUNT PIC 9(2).
01 EDGE-TABLE.
   05 EDGE-ID OCCURS 4 TIMES PIC 9(2).
01 NODE-STACK.
   05 STACK-ID OCCURS 20 TIMES PIC 9(2).
01 STACK-TOP      PIC 9(2) VALUE 0.
01 CURRENT-ID     PIC 9(2) VALUE 0.
01 TARGET-ID      PIC 9(2) VALUE 0.
01 EDGE-INDEX     PIC 9(2) VALUE 0.
01 EDGE-LAST      PIC 9(2) VALUE 0.
01 TOTAL-SIZE     PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
01 DISPLAY-SIZE   PIC ZZZ9.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN.
    MOVE "F" TO NODE-TYPE(1)
    MOVE 2 TO NODE-VALUE(1)
    MOVE "F" TO NODE-TYPE(2)
    MOVE 3 TO NODE-VALUE(2)
    MOVE "F" TO NODE-TYPE(3)
    MOVE 5 TO NODE-VALUE(3)

    MOVE "D" TO NODE-TYPE(4)
    MOVE 1 TO NODE-EDGE-START(4)
    MOVE 2 TO NODE-EDGE-COUNT(4)
    MOVE 2 TO EDGE-ID(1)
    MOVE 3 TO EDGE-ID(2)

    MOVE "D" TO NODE-TYPE(5)
    MOVE 3 TO NODE-EDGE-START(5)
    MOVE 2 TO NODE-EDGE-COUNT(5)
    MOVE 1 TO EDGE-ID(3)
    MOVE 4 TO EDGE-ID(4)

    MOVE 1 TO TARGET-ID
    PERFORM CALCULATE-SIZE
    MOVE TOTAL-SIZE TO DISPLAY-SIZE
    DISPLAY "leaf=" FUNCTION TRIM(DISPLAY-SIZE)

    MOVE 4 TO TARGET-ID
    PERFORM CALCULATE-SIZE
    MOVE TOTAL-SIZE TO DISPLAY-SIZE
    DISPLAY "docs=" FUNCTION TRIM(DISPLAY-SIZE)

    MOVE 5 TO TARGET-ID
    PERFORM CALCULATE-SIZE
    MOVE TOTAL-SIZE TO DISPLAY-SIZE
    DISPLAY "root=" FUNCTION TRIM(DISPLAY-SIZE)

    STOP RUN.

CALCULATE-SIZE.
    MOVE 0 TO TOTAL-SIZE
    MOVE 1 TO STACK-TOP
    MOVE TARGET-ID TO STACK-ID(STACK-TOP)

    PERFORM UNTIL STACK-TOP = 0
        MOVE STACK-ID(STACK-TOP) TO CURRENT-ID
        SUBTRACT 1 FROM STACK-TOP

        IF NODE-TYPE(CURRENT-ID) = "F"
            ADD NODE-VALUE(CURRENT-ID) TO TOTAL-SIZE
        ELSE
            MOVE NODE-EDGE-START(CURRENT-ID) TO EDGE-INDEX
            COMPUTE EDGE-LAST = EDGE-INDEX + NODE-EDGE-COUNT(CURRENT-ID) - 1
            PERFORM UNTIL EDGE-INDEX > EDGE-LAST
                ADD 1 TO STACK-TOP
                MOVE EDGE-ID(EDGE-INDEX) TO STACK-ID(STACK-TOP)
                ADD 1 TO EDGE-INDEX
            END-PERFORM
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM.
